{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:18OptiViewAdsRuntime17ContentLayoutLockC","title":"ContentLayoutLock","roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentLayoutLock"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentLayoutLock"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"}],"symbolKind":"class"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentLayoutLock"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some RN host players (react-native-theoplayer) re-stamp their internal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"player frame from the host view’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"frame"}]},{"text":" on every layout pass","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"THEOplayerRCTView.layoutSubviews","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does ","type":"text"},{"code":"player.frame = self.frame","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"While the split transform is installed, the host view’s frame is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transformed bounding box, so each pass applies the layout fraction to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"picture a SECOND time — the content renders at fraction² of its box — and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drifts the picture out of the frozen content mask, exposing black regions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the box. react-native-video is immune: its layout stamps sublayers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from ","type":"text"},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which a transform never changes.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The lock captures the healthy pre-transform frame at acquisition and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-asserts it (through the host’s own frame API, via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"restamp"},{"type":"text","text":") whenever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the surface’s layer geometry deviates. Observed on the LAYER: UIView"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"geometry setters are not KVO-compliant, CALayer’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bounds"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— the same technique as the overlay host view’s host-layer observers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Construct on the main thread (it reads and may re-stamp view geometry);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"release","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" only invalidates the observations and is safe from any thread."}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pins a host player’s internal video surface to a fixed frame while the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"split-layout reflow has a transform installed on the host view (PLAYG-513)."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/release()"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock/init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock\/init(internalview_desiredframe_restamp_)","title":"init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"internalView","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UIView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIView"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"desiredFrame","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CGRect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CGRect"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"restamp","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"CGRect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CGRect"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"OptiViewAdsRuntime","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime","abstract":[{"text":"The iOS and tvOS runtime of the OptiView Ads SDK: the AVFoundation content-player adapter, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overlay ad renderer, and the Google IMA integrations.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock/release()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/release()","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"release"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock\/release()","abstract":[{"text":"Stops holding the frame. The host’s next layout pass re-stamps its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"geometry from the (by then restored) host view frame.","type":"text"}],"title":"release()"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock":{"title":"ContentLayoutLock","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ContentLayoutLock","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ContentLayoutLock","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Pins a host player’s internal video surface to a fixed frame while the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"split-layout reflow has a transform installed on the host view (PLAYG-513).","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock"}}}